Vendored VST3 public SDK headers
================================

This directory contains a subset of the VST3 public SDK by Steinberg
Media Technologies GmbH, vendored under the MIT license so that the
VST3 host in this project can be built without a separate SDK
install or a network round-trip during CI.

The full SDK is at https://github.com/steinbergmedia/vst3sdk. Only
the public header files needed by src/server/vst3_host.cpp are
included here; the SDK's implementation .cpp files are not vendored
(the host loads plugins dynamically via dlopen/LoadLibrary at
runtime).

What is vendored
----------------

* pluginterfaces/base/  - the Steinberg::FUnknown base interface and
  platform alignment macros.
* pluginterfaces/vst/   - IComponent, IAudioProcessor, the bus
  structures, ProcessData, ProcessSetup, and the supporting
  interfaces.
* public.sdk/source/vst/hosting/ - the VST3 host-side helpers
  (HostClasses, ProcessData, parameter-changes queue, etc.).

What is NOT vendored
--------------------

* The SDK's .cpp implementation files.
* The SDK's CMake build system, base utilities, audio GUI, examples,
  tutorials, validator, and helper scripts.
* Submodule contents outside of pluginterfaces/ and
  public.sdk/source/vst/hosting/.

Why a subset and not the full SDK
---------------------------------

The full VST3 SDK is several thousand files and tens of thousands of
lines, most of which is GUI toolkit code, validator tools, examples,
and a CMake build system that is not useful here. The host in this
project only ever needs the public ABI headers to compile against.
Vendoring only the headers keeps the repository small and avoids
maintenance churn from upstream SDK changes that do not affect the
ABI surface used here.

How to update
-------------

To refresh the vendored headers from upstream, run from the
repository root:

  git clone --depth 1 --recurse-submodules https://github.com/steinbergmedia/vst3sdk.git /tmp/vst3sdk
  rsync -a --delete /tmp/vst3sdk/pluginterfaces/base/ third_party/vst3/pluginterfaces/base/
  rsync -a --delete /tmp/vst3sdk/pluginterfaces/vst/  third_party/vst3/pluginterfaces/vst/
  rsync -a --delete /tmp/vst3sdk/public.sdk/source/vst/hosting/ third_party/vst3/public.sdk/source/vst/hosting/
  cp /tmp/vst3sdk/LICENSE.txt third_party/vst3/LICENSE.txt
  rm -rf /tmp/vst3sdk

Review the diff before committing. ABI-breaking changes upstream
require a corresponding update to src/server/vst3_host.cpp; the
host's compile errors on CI will surface the breakage.

License
-------

The vendored headers are MIT-licensed by Steinberg Media
Technologies GmbH. The full license text is in LICENSE.txt in this
directory. Each header also retains its original copyright header
from the upstream SDK.

In addition to the MIT terms, the upstream SDK's
VST3_Usage_Guidelines.pdf and LICENSE.txt apply to anyone who
distributes the SDK headers (which this repository does). The
trademark guidelines in particular restrict the use of the "VST" and
"VST3" trademarks; this project complies by using the names
descriptively only.
